sequenceDiagram
  actor Visitor
  participant Browser
  participant Flask as Flask app.py
  participant Model as In-memory pickle objects
  participant Jinja as Jinja templates
  Visitor->>Browser: Enter a book title
  Browser->>Flask: POST /recommend_books
  Flask->>Model: Find exact title in pt.index
  Model-->>Flask: Index position and similarity row
  Flask->>Model: Resolve top candidate metadata
  Model-->>Flask: Title, author, cover URL
  Flask->>Jinja: Render recommendation page
  Jinja-->>Browser: HTML response
  Note over Flask,Model: Current unknown-title handling can raise IndexError
